they won't be done by Google.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:33.789
And to me, that's an awesome
situation to be in, right?

00:08:33.789 --> 00:08:36.760
So before I leave
the stage and start

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.309
inviting my partners to
kind of come here on stage

00:08:39.309 --> 00:08:41.336
